      "source": "md/试卷/试卷_LangChain_Agent工具调用.md",
      "tags": [
        "langchain-agents"
      ],
      "created": "2026-08-18T21:17:04.000656+00:00",
      "history": [],
      "review_material": {
        "prompt": "为什么没有 checkpointer 时每次 invoke 都从新 state 开始？thread_id、checkpointer、messages 各负责什么？",
        "answer": "checkpointer 按 thread_id 保存和恢复 Agent state 的快照；messages 是 state 中最重要的字段。没有 checkpointer 就没有跨 invoke 的恢复；只传 thread_id 也没有可恢复的存档。",
        "legacy_id": "review-20260710-langchain-agent-checkpointer-state"
      }
    },
    "Agent result 与 AIMessage.content": {
      "card": {
        "card_id": 1787087824000,
        "state": 1,
        "step": 0,
        "stability": null,
